{"id":"a6633b5006df9be9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Godel Operation Closure","display":"df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure — ZFC Inner3 Godel Operation Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure — ZFC Inner3 Godel Operation Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-godel-operation-closure — ZFC Inner3 Godel Operation Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function.md\">58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d83d7732ede02eef\" href=\"?note=d83d7732ede02eef\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathbf G,a,I,C,n,k,m,c,b,\\vec c\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathbf G,a,I,C,n,k,m,c,b,\\vec c\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompCode}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalRud}\">\\(\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d83d7732ede02eef\" href=\"?note=d83d7732ede02eef\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a)\">\\(\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a)\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限复合代码族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的域与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的域相同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\\)</span> 和原有三元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3GodelOperationClosure}_S(X,\\mathbf G,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3GodelOperationClosure}_S(X,\\mathbf G,a)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,0}(C,a)&amp;:=\n\\{\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,j):j\\in n\\}\n\\cup\\{C(i):i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\land a(i)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k+1}(C,a)&amp;:=\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}):m\\in\\omega,\\\nb\\in\\mathsf{Gen}_{m,k}(C,a),\\ \\vec c\\in(\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a))^m\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,0}(C,a)&amp;:=\n\\{\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,j):j\\in n\\}\n\\cup\\{C(i):i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(C)\\land a(i)=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k+1}(C,a)&amp;:=\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a)\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}):m\\in\\omega,\\\nb\\in\\mathsf{Gen}_{m,k}(C,a),\\ \\vec c\\in(\\mathsf{Gen}_{n,k}(C,a))^m\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,I,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,I,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(C(i),a(i))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall h\\in9\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathsf{Gen}_{\\mathbf b(h),k}(C,a)\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in V^{\\mathbf b(h)}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(d,\\vec x)=\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(h),\\vec x)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,I,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,I,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(C(i),a(i))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall h\\in9\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathsf{Gen}_{\\mathbf b(h),k}(C,a)\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in V^{\\mathbf b(h)}\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{EvalRud}(d,\\vec x)=\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(h),\\vec x)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X,C,I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(X\\ne\\varnothing\\land I=\\operatorname{dom}(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf G(i)=\\{\\langle\\vec x,\\operatorname{EvalRud}(C(i),\\vec x)\\rangle:\\vec x\\in X^{a(i)}\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists X,C,I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(X\\ne\\varnothing\\land I=\\operatorname{dom}(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{RudBasisCodes}_{58,S}(C,a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf G(i)=\\{\\langle\\vec x,\\operatorname{EvalRud}(C(i),\\vec x)\\rangle:\\vec x\\in X^{a(i)}\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}godel\\text{-}operation\\text{-}closure}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3GodelOperationClosure}_S(X,\\mathbf G,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\\land X\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G),\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G)\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G(i),X^{a(i)},X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}godel\\text{-}operation\\text{-}closure}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3GodelOperationClosure}_S(X,\\mathbf G,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GodelRudimentaryBasis}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathbf G,a)\\land X\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G),\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf G))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf G)\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf G(i),X^{a(i)},X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“基”现在由具体代码及其全宇宙求值刻画：每个所选运算都是 rudimentary，九个固定生成元均可由所选运算和投影复合表示。没有把“是标准基”当作未解释的断言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf G(i)\">\\(\\mathbf G(i)\\)</span> 是这些类运算在同一集合载体上的限制图，不是声称全宇宙类函数本身是集合。所有基元均为正元数，且基非空；原有非空载体与函数域条件把该载体与最后一个公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 绑定。</li>\n<li>允许任意满足生成条件的有限基，未把调用接口改成固定九项函数表。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-a